{
  "notes": "Deep house, F minor, 122 BPM, a light shuffle. A DX Rhodes comping rootless minor-ninth shells (b3, b7, 9) on the offbeats, a round sampled bass an octave down that answers the kick, the player's soft vocal ooh on the Smart Keys, and the HOUSE kit: four on the floor, clap on 2 and 4, open hats on the offbeats, a shaker in sixteenths, a little pumping. Scenes: A NIGHTFALL holds Fm7 with the Rhodes chord and a long bass; B PULSE vamps i7 iv7; C HEAT climbs bVI bVII with congas; D AFTERGLOW floats on bVImaj7 iv7. ENERGY: Rhodes alone, then kick and bass, then clap, offbeat hats and shaker eighths, then sixteenths, congas, fills and ratchets. All material is original.",
